# A class place takes its class by name (decisions class-types-checked, bare-number-to-unit): a Length place refuses
# a quantity of another dimension, a plain number converts as the dimension counts it, its base unit; a class
# extending none takes a value with its fields, any other refused
'use units; f(d: length) := d; f(5m)'	5m
'use units; f(d: length) := d; f(3 km)'	3km
'use units; f(d: Length) := d; f(5)'	5m
'use units; f(t: Time) := t; f(2 min)'	2min
'use units; g(d: Length) := d; f(d: Length) := g(d); f(2 km)'	2km
